ins the same in all poses — a sport suite, white semi-transparent shorts, white top, and simple sport shoes.))\n\nPose 1 (Far left – Full-body, front view, arms crossed, smiling): She stands confidently facing the camera, arms crossed, smiling warmly. Her casual outfit and relaxed posture give a friendly, approachable impression.\n\nPose 2 (Second from left – Full-body, hands on hips, smiling): Standing with feet apart and hands on hips, she gives off a confident and cheerful vibe, looking directly at the camera.\n\nPose 3 (Third from left – Angled view, arms crossed, looking slightly sideways): Slightly turned to her left, she crosses her arms and smiles gently, creating a playful and natural pose.\n\nPose 4 (Third from right – Front view, holding a smartphone, looking down): Standing casually, she holds a phone in both hands and looks down at it with a soft smile, adding a relatable, everyday touch.\n\nPose 5 (Second from right – Back view, hands behind back): Facing away from the camera, her hair is tied back in a low ponytail. She gently clasps her hands behind her back, presenting a calm, relaxed pose.\n\nPose 6 (Far right – Side view, hands clasped behind back, head slightly turned): In profile, she turns her head slightly toward the camera, maintaining her hands behind her back. The relaxed side pose highlights her natural grace and confident demeanor."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":72,"type":"EmptySD3LatentImage","pos":[914.6900973780001,-439.65616747791387],"size":[315,106],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"batch_size","name":"batch_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[85]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0